{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"01640869fdb6b26c","type":"group","x":-1200,"y":640,"width":712,"height":400,"label":"Micantrum"},
		{"id":"a9c7775183f52ba6","x":-1140,"y":-880,"width":667,"height":260,"type":"group","label":"Diamante"},
		{"id":"d7f4c9e6e9fdf42d","type":"group","x":-1200,"y":-140,"width":320,"height":385,"label":"Wrap up"},
		{"id":"d9164191c95558a5","type":"group","x":1958,"y":-397,"width":290,"height":200,"label":"Submarine repairs complete"},
		{"id":"fadbab55c6cd7944","type":"group","x":2932,"y":191,"width":243,"height":208,"label":"Mirror Corridor"},
		{"id":"282ee9f4eec7006b","type":"group","x":-132,"y":-90,"width":461,"height":109,"label":"Departing for Arx"},
		{"id":"e2efefc8a9d8a77b","type":"group","x":1341,"y":-463,"width":244,"height":200,"label":"Crosscut Circle oath"},
		{"id":"374119a29a08d59d","type":"group","x":2617,"y":-106,"width":315,"height":114,"label":"Arzhang's fate"},
		{"id":"f7120724cbce0a8e","type":"group","x":-513,"y":-90,"width":317,"height":109,"label":"Where is Guy?"},
		{"id":"463c8de4feeb6271","type":"text","text":"Gomruss is paralysed and silenced while he watches two thugs struggle with his 'wife'. She is stabbed accidentally.","x":-774,"y":138,"width":278,"height":115,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"e70323507ce80ca0","type":"text","text":"Gomruss may dream about his 'wife'.","x":-1180,"y":165,"width":280,"height":60},
		{"id":"11e01cc364fcf672","type":"text","text":"Gomruss uses a candle of invocation to enter the mirror plane.","x":1721,"y":-100,"width":250,"height":85},
		{"id":"d1bfab35cafee44a","type":"text","text":"The Six of Steel find Darkhalijz in the form of a fur cloak.","x":1707,"y":233,"width":279,"height":60},
		{"id":"1c86d2e1f48e2b12","type":"text","text":"Snicker Nickelfoot saw a miner fall to his death in the Resonant Mines, triggering the unionisation of the miners. The Ministry could not confirm the existence of the fallen miner and prevented the implementation of better health and safety in the mines.","x":-1180,"y":660,"width":672,"height":115,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"48645eed46978a68","type":"text","text":"Spiro encouraged his sister to intervene. Aura instructed the Garnetgrinder Clan to sell shares of the Resonant Mines and outlawed monopolies on essential goods like resonite.","x":-1180,"y":795,"width":672,"height":85,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"3b3076a86d7058a8","type":"text","text":"The Society of Brilliance, led by Zdenek, in league with the Micantrum Mining Consortium, modified Snicker's memory to persuade the Church to purchase resonite from MMC instead of GC. Zdenek, Malaika and Abishek are pulling strings across the Relief to accrue enough resources to create their own demi-plane.","x":-1180,"y":900,"width":672,"height":115,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"4fc2a59f471ef417","type":"text","text":"Blythe found a business card with an eye sigil. When burned, it produced the smell of joose, which Gomruss inhaled. Joose is a drug commonly found in Micantrum.","x":-1700,"y":525,"width":368,"height":115,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"f9a033a4e0f0c673","type":"text","text":"The same sigil was tattooed onto Loronath and stamped into Daniel's ring. They are members of the Society of Brilliance. The business card was a recruitment puzzle.","x":-1700,"y":660,"width":368,"height":115},
		{"id":"26b165fa8404fa4c","type":"text","text":"### Tomb of Darkhalijz\nMirror mephits attack!","x":1721,"y":66,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"68352cb1a28cd6ef","type":"text","text":"The thief king, Darkhalijz, made a deal for immortality with Abishek. Trapped beneath a mountain of his own gold, his resurrections became a never-ending cycle, earning him a half-life as a cloak.","x":1775,"y":440,"width":451,"height":115,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"1a5dc569e6b96955","type":"text","text":"The Six of Steel join the Crosscut Circle and depart for Mundi Eversor.","x":1978,"y":-377,"width":250,"height":85},
		{"id":"c3d81e1b86a93fd5","type":"text","text":"The Crosscut Circle depart for Mundi Eversor alone.","x":1978,"y":-272,"width":250,"height":55},
		{"id":"f0c514a804ad590c","type":"text","text":"The Six of Steel find Darkhalijz's staff and use it to enter the mirror plane.","x":2065,"y":163,"width":250,"height":85},
		{"id":"d2b374349ed7fa8e","type":"text","text":"## Mirror Plane","x":2098,"y":64,"width":184,"height":31},
		{"id":"ddc47a5787f90ed7","type":"text","text":"Firien reveals the existence of Ten.","x":1633,"y":-443,"width":176,"height":55},
		{"id":"9129504489bdb567","type":"text","text":"Vetra intends to resurrect Tenebrae (Arzhang) to prove Caelum created the Miasma.","x":1602,"y":-678,"width":239,"height":115,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"71bbe178f6280514","type":"text","text":"Miyoko, the petrified dinosaur rider, sought out Aequor, guardian of Antiqua, to help the Six of Steel.","x":140,"y":-333,"width":309,"height":85,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0d2db328990a5fe9","type":"text","text":"Gomruss returns Roshia's pocket watch, restoring her memory of the Inquisition's attack on the Dawnroot Druids.","x":1285,"y":148,"width":281,"height":115},
		{"id":"fc35c8b2a95e492d","type":"text","text":"The Six of Steel meet Roshia outside the Tomb of Darkhalijz.","x":1322,"y":6,"width":208,"height":85},
		{"id":"a8279b797a574ee2","type":"text","text":"## Arx","x":1163,"y":-73,"width":87,"height":31},
		{"id":"d7f84b3ae8bf1616","type":"text","text":"Gomruss realises the watch indicates he has missing memories. Activating the watch has no effect as Gomruss has blocked the memories himself.","x":1396,"y":440,"width":329,"height":115,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"50702e5683ea6807","type":"text","text":"The Inquisition confiscated a memory stone hidden in the water portal. The druids shared its memory with Roshia before the attack.","x":1020,"y":440,"width":326,"height":115,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"33a4073e016793e8","type":"file","file":"Gamemaster/Roshia's Investigation.md","x":983,"y":660,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b540f4a27e93ec05","type":"text","text":"The Crosscut Circle take Firien's oath.","x":1360,"y":-443,"width":204,"height":55},
		{"id":"b73870a9634e4d09","type":"text","text":"The Crosscut Circle refuse to take Firien's oath.","x":1360,"y":-368,"width":204,"height":85},
		{"id":"121d5f7bff063af3","type":"text","text":"The Six of Steel meet the Crosscut Circle at an abandoned port outside of Arx.","x":1322,"y":-207,"width":282,"height":85},
		{"id":"8094c78528e824be","type":"text","text":"The Six of Steel meet the Feywild Ones in Arx.","x":620,"y":344,"width":230,"height":60},
		{"id":"6b97351adcfe55f2","type":"text","text":"The Six of Steel encounter Aequor who will lead them to a pillar under the sea.","x":610,"y":-221,"width":250,"height":85},
		{"id":"432b7cab92dda71a","type":"text","text":"The remaining Feywild Ones take Firien's oath.","x":644,"y":178,"width":182,"height":85},
		{"id":"01127e2c17ab84ad","type":"text","text":"The Feywild Ones take the Verity in search of more pillars.","x":627,"y":26,"width":216,"height":85},
		{"id":"9d30acd23d53263b","type":"file","file":"Gamemaster/Ten's Pillars.md","x":535,"y":-763,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b67e6dd9a6bcab09","type":"text","text":"Roshia takes the oath.","x":628,"y":484,"width":213,"height":27},
		{"id":"eae1122b5240450f","type":"text","text":"Miyoko returned to Crowswood Place on Flavum 1st. Glimback told her about the pillar.","x":153,"y":-500,"width":284,"height":85},
		{"id":"acb58b308ef83496","type":"text","text":"Guy stays with Elyse.","x":-496,"y":-72,"width":281,"height":27},
		{"id":"32bdb676b38cf8f5","type":"file","file":"Gamemaster/Oath-takers.md","x":-90,"y":170,"width":400,"height":407,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"1e8b491c2edbcd00","type":"text","text":"Firien sends the Feywild Ones to Arx.","x":-114,"y":-71,"width":424,"height":27},
		{"id":"1e389f36e1413395","type":"text","text":"Firien summons the Feywild Ones to Sullivanwick.","x":-114,"y":-25,"width":424,"height":27},
		{"id":"60be0f9722151183","type":"text","text":"# PART 5","x":-741,"y":-127,"width":139,"height":35},
		{"id":"2d27c94f54cc3e77","type":"text","text":"The Aubrey is towed back to Sullivanwick for refit.","x":-1180,"y":-120,"width":280,"height":55},
		{"id":"90c8b1456f2814fd","type":"text","text":"Guy stays with the Six of Steel.","x":-496,"y":-25,"width":281,"height":27},
		{"id":"7f2831646c83ed32","type":"text","text":"The Crosscut circle escaped to Arx with the submarine.","x":-1180,"y":-278,"width":280,"height":55,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"984955d75d7065be","type":"text","text":"Roshia contacts Gomruss about the missing Os Terrae expedition.","x":-1180,"y":-45,"width":280,"height":85,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c37471e8b09bc993","type":"text","text":"While celebrating, Gomruss may confide in the Six of Steel about his 'wife'.","x":-1180,"y":60,"width":280,"height":85},
		{"id":"01b45cbc88e86394","type":"text","text":"### Antiquan Chapel\n\nGurdeep is charmed by his late wife, Setsuko. If the charm is broken, Setsuko transforms into a banshee.","x":3340,"y":372,"width":444,"height":110,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"3db0235f17017b7f","type":"text","text":"### Bone Cay Cemetery\n\nCharis is restrained and tortured by cultists in an alternative memory.","x":3340,"y":242,"width":313,"height":110,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"67b02bdbe11b483e","type":"text","text":"### Nox Blizzard\n\nXander and his wife, Ylva Once-Felled, are blinded by Nox's perpetual blizzard as they seek refuge. Ice spiders attack.","x":3340,"y":502,"width":500,"height":110,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e404045a52531133","type":"text","text":"The thugs find Isma. Gomruss is paralysed and silenced while he watches them struggle with his 'wife'. She is stabbed accidentally. Gomruss cries for help with increasing volume to no avail.","x":3720,"y":255,"width":547,"height":85,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cfbfbc150276c65f","type":"text","text":"Isma, now a local merchant, asks Gomruss for help when thugs come looking for her. She requests he pose as her husband to nullify Abishek's claim to her.","x":3860,"y":385,"width":451,"height":85,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a79e6e56f3fb14cd","type":"text","text":"Gomruss recalls rescuing Isma from a sandstorm when she first escaped the Miasma. Giant spiders attacked.","x":3920,"y":515,"width":321,"height":85,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c701e90ffc19e1f2","type":"text","text":"### Chequerboard Demiplane\n\nThe Mirror Six of Steel attack! The Six of Steel must free Chance from a giant hourglass before time (River's contract) runs out (10 turns).","x":3340,"y":20,"width":409,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"12c741f00217d89c","type":"text","text":"Releasing Chance breaks River Chapman's contract with Malaika, the alu-fiend who granted him the power to trap Chance. River disappears and Malaika hints at the truth.","x":3820,"y":33,"width":381,"height":115,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ae1d474c18591ec1","type":"text","text":"Tymora's emissary, Chance, has been trapped in the mirror plane by River Chapman, who is using her luck to influence his business and income.","x":2455,"y":66,"width":331,"height":115,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"a23fb9a9331d1962","type":"text","text":"Doctor Gurdeep Darshan's expedition into the Tomb of Darkhalijz became trapped in the mirror plane when they disturbed the ancient tabaxi's banishing staff.","x":2455,"y":238,"width":364,"height":115,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"3a97aca0782d5fef","type":"text","text":"The Six of Steel find the final memory in Mundi Eversor's diamond heart.","x":3046,"y":-174,"width":236,"height":85,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"4037b752190efbd6","type":"text","text":"Arzhang escapes.","x":2637,"y":-86,"width":250,"height":27},
		{"id":"3bf59f1b045dda0e","type":"text","text":"Chance","x":2952,"y":211,"width":203,"height":27},
		{"id":"6bc33be8bc296b5f","type":"text","text":"Charis Madizos","x":2952,"y":258,"width":203,"height":27},
		{"id":"a5183663dfc975c3","type":"text","text":"Gurdeep Darshan","x":2952,"y":305,"width":203,"height":27},
		{"id":"2981285b159dd898","type":"text","text":"Xander Coppermane","x":2952,"y":352,"width":203,"height":27},
		{"id":"f81e5b1c4c18b1c2","type":"text","text":"Arzhang is killed permanently.","x":2637,"y":-39,"width":275,"height":27},
		{"id":"cae447632cd9b88b","type":"text","text":"Vetra, working for Abishek, conducts a ritual to resurrect Arzhang.","x":2319,"y":-233,"width":243,"height":85},
		{"id":"9fe0cec19b2604f4","type":"text","text":"Vetra betrays the Crosscut Circle.","x":2315,"y":-364,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"4e850e1ee7a14c25","type":"text","text":"### Mundi Eversor\n\nArzhang attacks!","x":2344,"y":-89,"width":194,"height":80,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"702f1cf2e2ec09c3","type":"text","text":"Magical trees were encroaching on Diamante territory. Émeraude called for the cessation of deforestation. The Feywild Ones sought out Lothran in the Sylvan Kingdoms. They found a way to placate the trees.","x":-1700,"y":-1003,"width":458,"height":115},
		{"id":"dedf5074e1d86e43","type":"text","text":"The Queen of Diamante invited the Feywild Ones and the Six of Steel to a ball following successful negotiations with the Emmeraude Republic. ","x":-1700,"y":-868,"width":458,"height":85,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"942e2935e12bbf8b","type":"text","text":"Lothran secretly planted the seeds of Anfarwol, their patron, to immobilise the trees. As the seeds grow they will sap the life from Émeraude forest.","x":-1120,"y":-860,"width":330,"height":115},
		{"id":"c3cc9357c53580b0","type":"text","text":"Protesters from Émeraude will crash the Queen's ball, claiming that the deforestation is continuing in secret.","x":-770,"y":-860,"width":277,"height":115},
		{"id":"3532b047f6845d4c","type":"text","text":"Baldassare Leonardi may take the opportunity to declare martial law.","x":-770,"y":-725,"width":277,"height":85},
		{"id":"1db1021603b85975","x":-1120,"y":-725,"width":330,"height":85,"type":"text","text":"Anfarwol with arise from Émeraude Forest if not stopped."}
	],
